{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "behind-the-scenes-s01e09-scene-16",
  "pair": "zh-en",
  "title": "三天之内探个准信  (Sounding Out the Boss Within Three Days)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "kaiwen": "凯文",
    "xingzi": "杏子",
    "bu_xiaogu": "布小谷"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "After Bu Xiaogu bolts out of the room full of energy, Kaiwen and Xingzi trade theories about Chun Yuqiao's feelings toward her. Listen to their Mandarin conversation.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "这姑娘今天是怎么了，干劲这么足？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "你说老大那边，到底是什么意思啊？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "你这大情感专家，连你都判断不了啊？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "我哪知道啊，我毕竟不是男的嘛。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "那行，这事包在我身上，我三天之内给你探个准信。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "真是人人都有一颗八卦的心，大老爷们也这么八卦。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "不过话说回来，如果这事真能成的话，老大的好日子就来了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "而且咱们俩的好日子也跟着来了！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "这又是什么意思啊？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "咱们这么多年的心愿，不就是盼着老大能幸福吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "他要是嫁出去了，咱们俩身上的重担就解开了，可以过二人世界了！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "师兄，有没有时间一起喝东西？",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "这姑娘今天是怎么了，干劲这么足？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'What got into that girl today that she is so fired up?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "你说老大那边，到底是什么意思啊？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Tell me, what is really on the boss's mind?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "你这大情感专家，连你都判断不了啊？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'You are the big romance expert—cannot even you figure it out?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "我哪知道啊，我毕竟不是男的嘛。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'How would I know? After all, I am not a man.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "那行，这事包在我身上，我三天之内给你探个准信。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Alright then, leave this to me; within three days I will sound him out and get a firm answer.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "真是人人都有一颗八卦的心，大老爷们也这么八卦。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Everyone really does have a gossipy heart—even grown men gossip like this.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "不过话说回来，如果这事真能成的话，老大的好日子就来了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Still, come to think of it, if this really works out, good days will finally arrive for the boss.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "而且咱们俩的好日子也跟着来了！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'And good days will arrive for the two of us right along with him!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "这又是什么意思啊？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'What do you mean by that?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "咱们这么多年的心愿，不就是盼着老大能幸福吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Has our wish all these years not been for the boss to find happiness?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "他要是嫁出去了，咱们俩身上的重担就解开了，可以过二人世界了！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Once he gets married off, the heavy burden on our shoulders lifts and we can enjoy time for just us two!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "师兄，有没有时间一起喝东西？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Senior brother, do you have time to grab a drink together?'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "这姑娘今天是怎么了，干劲这么足？",
